data: {"item_id":"rs_929265","output_index":0,"sequence_number":108,"summary_index":0,"text":"Okay, the user asked me to say hello. Let me make sure I respond in the right way. They want a short sentence, so I need to keep it simple. I should use a friendly greeting like \"Hello!\" and maybe add a welcoming message. Let me check if there's anything else they might need. Since they just said hello, probably just a polite response is enough. Alright, I'll go with \"Hello! How can I assist you today?\" That's concise and offers help, which is good.\n","type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done"}

